/// Rebuild examples/turbo_outrun_intro.mlaproj: the C64 title theme requested at
/// https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qG82RMyS07Y (Jeroen Tel, HVSC subtune 2).
/// Opening 48 bars; notes/timing/articulation transcribed from the original SID.
/// SID-synthesized percussion replaces the original digital drum samples.
